          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "There are 9 transcripts of interviews with different categories of respondents: farmers, architects, urban planners, project managers, public servants reffering to the Overdiepse polder case. There are 4 image files with pictures taken during observation of the Hegewarren case study. There is a file containing a template of the information sheet and the consent form distributed to the interviewees.  Transcripts of interviews are not available to the wider audience due to privacy or ethical restrictions. Access within the RECOMS-project can be permitted.   For further information regarding this research project and the RECOMS MSCA ITN please access https://recoms.eu/"
          },
